        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Relationship guide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid connectors show declared foreign keys. A 1-to-many label describes the referenced parent and referencing child. Optional links are marked nullable in the entity fields.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; JSON fields are shown as attributes and may contain structured data not represented as separate tables. Audit IDs are not foreign keys in the schema." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#F3F6FA;strokeColor=#A6B8C8;fontSize=13;fontColor=#263746;" vertex="1" parent="1">
